<title>NEW ZEALAND: Klaus Sorensen appointed CEO of Shandwick NZ Ltd.</title>
<headline>Klaus Sorensen appointed CEO of Shandwick NZ Ltd.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Klaus Sorensen has been appointed chief executive of public relations company Shandwick New Zealand Ltd, Shandwick NZ said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Sorensen is to merge his Wellington-based public relations consultancy with Shandwick NZ.</p>
<p>Shandwick has 92 offices worldwide and is listed on the London Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
